abstract: "An independently authored Proof Protocol mapping connecting EU NIS2 (Directive (EU) 2022/2555) Article 21 risk-management measures, Article 23 reporting, and Implementing Regulation (EU) 2024/2690 context to evidence, efficacy measurements, and proof artifacts. A Proof Protocol result is not a legal or regulatory determination."
